          quote: "Kaliya Hamlin, Drummond Reed, Doc Searls and I are hosting the Internet Identity Workshop in Berkeley on October 26 and 27th ( Note: this changed from 25th and 26th )",
          note: "The announcement lists proposals to be compared, including 'Microsoft's InfoCard system', 'OpenID' and 'XRI/XDI (i-names)'.",
