      place: "European Parliament, Brussels",
      body: "Regulation (EU) 2016/679, the General Data Protection Regulation, was signed at Brussels on 27 April 2016 and published in the Official Journal on 4 May 2016, to apply from 25 May 2018. Article 21(5) lets a person exercise the right to object to processing, in the context of information society services, 'by automated means using technical specifications'. Article 25 requires data protection by design and by default, so that by default only the personal data necessary for each specific purpose are processed.",
