          quote: "PersonAgent is a software or machine agent that acts on behalf of the Person, and interacts with the EntityAgent which acts on behalf of the Entity. … The PersonAgent and EntityAgent keep a record of the request, negotiation, and contract by logging each step (as required or when relevant) within a AgreementInteractionRecord. … The [ IEEE-P7012 ] draft standard references [ DPV ] in its appendix as an example of a vocabulary that can be used to express the relevant information for the creation and use of privacy terms in its defined processes.",
