          note: "Same page: 'Gilmore also led EFF's effort to design and build the DES Cracker' and 'That is why the EFF Board of Directors has recently made the difficult decision to vote to remove Gilmore from the Board.' Gilmore's own home page attributes his removal to 'a spasm of political correctness during the Covid pandemic'.",
