          quote: "June 2, 1994, New York Times, \"Scientist Finds Flaw In Code Technology\"",
          note: "Index of press items; dates the Times story to 2 June 1994. Blaze recalls the front-page headline as 'Flaw Found in Federal Plan for Wiretapping'. The nytimes.com archive copy (John Markoff) returned 403 to scripts and was not read. Index page date approximate (course materials, mid-1990s).",
          verificationStatus: "CONFIRMED",
          accessType: "FREE"
