          date: "2000-08",
          url: "https://autoriteitpersoonsgegevens.nl/uploads/imported/av11.pdf",
          quote: "Since the identity protector is under the control of the user, he/she can set it to perform a variety of functions such as revealing his or her actual identity to certain service providers, but not to others.",
          note: "The PDF says it is a 'Revised edition of: Rossum, H. van, e.a. (1995). Privacy-enhancing Technologies: the path to anonymity.' Library records list Ann Cavoukian among the 1995 authors; that authorship was not seen in the fetched revised edition.",
          verificationStatus: "CONFIRMED",
