          date: "2016-04-26",
          url: "https://www.lifewithalacrity.com/article/the-path-to-self-soverereign-identity/",
          quote: "At all of these events I want to share a vision for how we can enhance the ability of digital identity to enable trust while preserving individual privacy. This vision is what I call “Self-Sovereign Identity”.",
